description=<H1>Forged by Combat
description= <BR>
description=<TEXT>Kill zombies with melee weapons to earn XP and level up your Fighting Skill perk. No XP boost — only your kill count matters. <LINE>
description=<TEXT>One-handed weapons reward speed. Two-handed weapons reward power. <LINE>
description= <BR>
description=<TEXT>10 levels of progression: <LINE>
description=<TEXT>- Levels 0–2: Penalties to damage and attack speed. You're not a fighter yet. <LINE>
description=<TEXT>- Level 3: Baseline. You hold your own. <LINE>
description=<TEXT>- Levels 4–10: Growing bonuses to damage, speed, and critical chance. <LINE>
description= <BR>
description=<TEXT>Features: <LINE>
description=<TEXT>- Melee kills only — vehicles, stomps, and ranged weapons don't count <LINE>
description=<TEXT>- Profession and trait starting bonuses <LINE>
description=<TEXT>- Three sandbox difficulties: Soft, Medium, Brutal <LINE>
description=<TEXT>- Mid-game install compatible
